{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"3JN","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"約翰三書","commonName":"約翰三書","title":"約翰三書","order":64,"numberOfChapters":1,"sha256":"f4f733f6e66271908fe8758f2a5afcfcd1123d863a2e10fa11ee5ed810b956fc","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/3JN/1.json","lastChapterNumber":1,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/3JN/1.json","totalNumberOfVerses":15},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["問候"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["作長老的寫信給親愛的該猶，就是我誠心所愛的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["親愛的兄弟啊，我願你凡事興盛，身體健壯，正如你的靈魂興盛一樣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["有弟兄來證明你心裏存的真理，正如你按真理而行，我就甚喜樂。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我聽見我的兒女們按真理而行，我的喜樂就沒有比這個大的。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["合作和反對"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["親愛的兄弟啊，凡你向作客旅之弟兄所行的都是忠心的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["他們在教會面前證明了你的愛；你若配得過上帝，幫助他們往前行，這就好了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["因他們是為主的名",{"noteId":0},"出外，對於外邦人一無所取。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["所以我們應該接待這樣的人，叫我們與他們一同為真理做工。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["我曾略略地寫信給教會，但那在教會中好為首的丟特腓不接待我們。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["所以我若去，必要提說他所行的事，就是他用惡言妄論我們。還不以此為足，他自己不接待弟兄，有人願意接待，他也禁止，並且將接待弟兄的人趕出教會。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["親愛的兄弟啊，不要效法惡，只要效法善。行善的屬乎上帝；行惡的未曾見過上帝。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["低米丟行善，有眾人給他作見證，又有真理給他作見證，就是我們也給他作見證。你也知道我們的見證是真的。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["問安"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["我原有許多事要寫給你，卻不願意用筆墨寫給你，"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["但盼望快快地見你，我們就當面談論。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["願你平安。眾位朋友都問你安。請你替我按着姓名問眾位朋友安。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"-","text":"原文是那名","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":7}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/3JN/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JUD/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2JN/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}